       <h1>Actress Kimmarie Johnson Dies at 50</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Actress and model Kimmarie Johnson, known for her roles in &quot;Beverly Hills, 90210&quot; and &quot;Dude, Where's My Car?,&quot; has died at age 50. She passed away on Wednesday, Nov. 4, after suffering a heart event at her Los Angeles home on Oct. 27.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-05/actress-kimmarie-johnson-dies-at-50.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Following the incident, Johnson was transported to Cedars-Sinai Hospital, where she was diagnosed with a heart aneurysm condition. A former Miss USA contestant, Johnson was remembered by those around her for the warmth she radiated throughout her life and career.</p>
