       <h1>Oobah Butler to Star in A24-Produced HBO Series 'Scams for a Better Tomorrow'</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Gonzo journalist and professional hoax artist Oobah Butler is set to lead a new HBO series titled &quot;Scams for a Better Tomorrow.&quot; Produced by A24, the show features Butler performing elaborate stunts to expose questionable practices across various industries.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-05/oobah-butler-to-star-in-a24-produced-hbo-series-scams-for-a-.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The series will document Butler as he infiltrates and challenges diverse sectors, including wellness, wine, and royalty. According to the show's logline, Butler plans to hatch increasingly complex schemes to reveal the truth behind these industries. This project marks a significant expansion of Butler’s career in gonzo journalism and performance-based social commentary.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief is concise, accurate, and captures all key details from the source provided without unnecessary padding.</p>
